  "prefLabel": "Mec 301.02 Incidental repair installation and maintenance of plumbing",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Mec 301.02 “Incidental repair installation and maintenance of plumbing” means a job of minor consequence which occurs by chance and not requiring calculations or permits and inspections as mandated pursuant to NH RSA 155-A:2.\n\nSource. #10847, eff 7-1-15; ss by #13770, eff 12-10-23 (formerly Saf-Mec 301.20) (see Revision Note at chapter heading for Mec 300)",
